d": "1759901891583835", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819934_1759901894917168_1755884751114998428_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TpkFabh2XU8Q7kNvwFZ3bJB&_nc_oc=AdlSVYX--v7RZS1nNkAQASo_suphtUZ6En-uSg06G7IL8K2S_-zH-NlQqtCSKmwlvv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvJX35bg-u9LaqwENMn7Ld39qg98YnzncIclVGS3CcufQ&oe=69986305"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "691900473696934", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499326349_691900477030267_8034961341760562964_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zjgDOecfe64Q7kNvwEwtCu6&_nc_oc=AdnznxPIV_W1u78MX2m7KIz9gs7IMxNF-VGhE5fLUcbSXJI7zgTpg1zmTwBPecfTbDw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfubOik_YoIWJ3I_QFAQG1txO60olhCCzvPFS1iaEPfJBA&oe=69986EDD"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "701610639047065", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311591_701610642380398_6712854599056515091_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tZKZvn1r2KMQ7kNvwGcy576&_nc_oc=AdkPZqgQRFUkAQ38yykRRm-UiMCPrdaOIUdHB03pN-lHSUfkdTKtHWZvxllgmmsJdj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsLoghMQA_6KQ3y0rd4Xdl6AEYR8QWWPf3QSnxmYgPxiw&oe=699848D2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1448057773232210", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499318571_1448057776565543_7678358617141313131_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hC1F5XUuOFwQ7kNvwFQSA6B&_nc_oc=AdnJF-BE52Qq81gNiBdSJeyhvRO1sfI2AAz-w6seGE-It_VUL74AET6PO-AqtCncBtw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft5WEoxk4xA0y1YsXI9xG3AYCQec-nFCqIW1XzxdjSu8Q&oe=69985CDC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DF_MA_META_HEADER_COVERLAND_TRAILERCOVER.png", "id": "1646731639656721", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831792_1646731642990054_4019563495684792553_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MiJA8QlT8oUQ7kNvwE9O7bn&_nc_oc=Adl3b2BhU96A23T9dD2tVNhTwXKD6tPNyHAOl0oGqmaY_0wfxBzdo20qbtp-ZfBSyno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu597uvpUY5ZIdZDk-EmJe_aPle72h3vqSFzws3HxHDbQ&oe=69984357"}, "display_name": "Dragon Fist: VR Kung Fu", "keywords": ["fighting", "kungfu", "physics", "boxing", "simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n{1194756028402406}\n# **The Legend Begins...**\nA ruthless master rises. Vengeful emperors scheme. Peasants sharpen their blades. They all have something to prove\u2014and only one path forward: **Kung Fu.**\n\n{1903052986827168}\n# **Step Into Your Own Kung Fu Movie**\nYou\u2019re not watching a Kung Fu movie\u2014you\u2019re in it. Dragon Fist delivers fast-paced melee combat powered by physics and real martial arts.\n\n{808577998151364}\n# **Hone in Your Skills**\nPractice strikes, blocks, dodges, and combos. There is an endless amount of combat to explore.\n\n{354077967776881}\n# **Play Your Way**\n- Campaign\n- Multiplayer (up to 8)\n- Co-op Campaign\n- Training\n- and More...\n\n=========================\n\n# New DLC: Midnight Alley\n\nTake the fight to the streets! Midnight Alley contains a new environment for single and multiplayer modes, and 3 new characters.\n\n- **New Environment - The Alley:** A narrow streetside area lit by lanterns, windows and the moon. Features breakable doors that allow you to enter side buildings.\n- **3 New Characters:** Play as The Landlady, The Centipede, and White Eagle, each with their own perks, weaknesses, and special moves.", "short_description": "Step into your own Kung Fu Movie! This first-person Kung Fu fighter with stylized graphics, physics-based combat, and multiplayer pays homage to the golden era of martial arts films. Play with up to 8 friends in multiplayer modes like Co-Op, PvP, Challenges, or take on an expansive singleplayer campaign.